cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "JLaw-CiteGraph: An open citation graph of Japanese statutory law"
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Park"
    given-names: "Yabooung"
    alias: "yabooung"
    email: "horusr8@gmail.com"
abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible citation graph and search index of Japanese national statutory
  law, built deterministically from official e-Gov law XML: 8,998 laws at article /
  paragraph / item level (1.89M nodes, 1.42M resolved citation edges; 70,577 distinct
  law-to-law pairs), upcoming-amendment metadata, an embedding-free search CLI, and a
  retrieval benchmark on NTA tax Q&A. Snapshot: e-Gov 2026-09-27.
keywords:
  - Japanese law
  - legal NLP
  - citation graph
  - knowledge graph
  - statute
  - e-Gov
license: Apache-2.0
license-url: "https://github.com/yabooung/jp-law-citation-graph/blob/main/LICENSE"
version: "2.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-29"
url: "https://github.com/yabooung/jp-law-citation-graph"
